1
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:22,530
Zhijiang Rongliang Wuxian Technology (Zhejiang) Co., Ltd. Zhejiang Yanhe Culture Technology Co., Ltd.

2
00:01:12,400 --> 00:01:14,039
Lord Su, Mr. Shen, be careful.

3
00:01:14,039 --> 00:01:14,920
This guy is crazy.

4
00:01:14,920 --> 00:01:16,980
He bit a guard's hand just last night.

5
00:01:23,400 --> 00:01:25,660
You are the lost only son of the Xu family,

6
00:01:25,920 --> 00:01:26,920
Xu Lin.

7
00:01:27,120 --> 00:01:28,039
Lost?

8
00:01:28,840 --> 00:01:30,400
That was an abduction.

9
00:01:30,560 --> 00:01:31,480
Abduction?

10
00:01:32,280 --> 00:01:33,610
What exactly happened?

11
00:01:34,039 --> 00:01:35,120
My Xu family

12
00:01:35,320 --> 00:01:37,560
was a prominent family in Chang'an back then.

13
00:01:37,560 --> 00:01:39,759
My father was an official in charge of salt and iron.

14
00:01:39,759 --> 00:01:42,000
My mother was a lady from a noble family.

15
00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:44,920
I was supposed to be a young master living in luxury.

16
00:01:44,920 --> 00:01:47,680
But God is unfair.

17
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:56,680
Young Master,

18
00:01:56,680 --> 00:01:57,280
slow down.

19
00:01:58,200 --> 00:01:59,560
Young Master.

20
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:04,560
Young Master.

21
00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:06,340
Young Master, Little Master,

22
00:02:06,480 --> 00:02:07,280
where are you?

23
00:02:07,280 --> 00:02:08,880
Young Master, where are you?

24
00:02:09,560 --> 00:02:10,400
Young Master.

25
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:12,280
Young Master.

26
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:15,360
A-Cheng and the others are gone.

27
00:02:15,440 --> 00:02:17,520
No one will disturb our playtime anymore.

28
00:02:17,520 --> 00:02:20,560
Where is that fun thing you mentioned?

29
00:02:23,280 --> 00:02:24,680
Young Master, I'm sorry.

30
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:26,560
They forced me.

31
00:02:32,680 --> 00:02:33,560
Ah Cheng.

32
00:02:34,280 --> 00:02:36,680
Is this a new game?

33
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:39,120
Help! Help!

34
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:42,210
How much?

35
00:02:42,400 --> 00:02:43,130
Fifty taels.

36
00:02:44,360 --> 00:02:45,220
Too expensive.

37
00:02:45,280 --> 00:02:46,540
At least thirty taels.

38
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:49,280
He's a young master from a wealthy family.

39
00:02:49,280 --> 00:02:50,280
Top-grade goods.

40
00:02:51,280 --> 00:02:52,000
Deal.

41
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:08,280
From today on, you are mine.

42
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:10,560
I will teach you the most powerful martial arts.

43
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:11,890
Bone-Shrinking Skill.

44
00:03:16,600 --> 00:03:18,120
From today on,

45
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:20,680
your bones will stop growing.

46
00:03:20,880 --> 00:03:24,400
How else can you practice the Bone-Shrinking Skill?

47
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:27,079
Lift it.

48
00:03:28,280 --> 00:03:29,000
Lift it.

49
00:03:29,520 --> 00:03:31,520
If you want to be respected in public,

50
00:03:31,520 --> 00:03:33,380
you must suffer in private first.

51
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:35,000
Lift it.

52
00:03:35,120 --> 00:03:37,250
If you can't lift it, no dinner for you.

53
00:03:37,440 --> 00:03:41,240
I miss my parents. I miss my old life.

54
00:03:43,440 --> 00:03:45,900
Every day, I hoped they would come to save me.

55
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:47,329
But they didn't.

56
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:48,400
Nothing.

57
00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:51,000
Only endless abuse.

58
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:55,280
From today on, your bones will stop growing.

59
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:58,840
How else can you practice the Bone-Shrinking Skill?

60
00:04:10,680 --> 00:04:12,720
Good.

61
00:04:13,400 --> 00:04:14,440
Very good.

62
00:04:21,120 --> 00:04:21,800
Good.

63
00:04:22,040 --> 00:04:22,920
Next,

64
00:04:23,240 --> 00:04:24,800
is our finale,

65
00:04:25,240 --> 00:04:27,480
the Heaven-Swallowing Rat Spirit.

66
00:04:32,720 --> 00:04:34,040
Good.

67
00:04:41,480 --> 00:04:42,159
Very good.

68
00:04:42,560 --> 00:04:44,800
I'm sorry. They forced me.

69
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:58,920
Heaven-Swallowing Rat. Heaven-Swallowing Rat.

70
00:04:58,920 --> 00:05:01,600
The name Xu Lin has long been forgotten.

71
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:05,400
They called me the Heaven-Swallowing Rat.

72
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:07,480
Over twenty years have passed.

73
00:05:07,480 --> 00:05:09,480
I know I have long become a demon.

74
00:05:10,600 --> 00:05:12,720
I hate the people who took away my name,

75
00:05:12,720 --> 00:05:14,180
including the onlookers.

76
00:05:15,640 --> 00:05:16,770
They are all guilty.

77
00:05:17,240 --> 00:05:18,500
I burned them to death.

78
00:05:23,440 --> 00:05:25,600
When I went back to find my parents,

79
00:05:25,920 --> 00:05:27,800
I found out they were all dead.

80
00:05:28,240 --> 00:05:31,040
There is no one left in my family.

81
00:05:31,600 --> 00:05:32,800
I hate them.

82
00:05:34,400 --> 00:05:36,480
I want to kill them all.

83
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:37,010
Revenge.

84
00:05:37,360 --> 00:05:39,920
I returned all the suffering doubly.

85
00:05:48,159 --> 00:05:49,920
Zhang Ergou and the others broke the law.

86
00:05:49,920 --> 00:05:51,720
Why didn't you report to the officials?

87
00:05:51,720 --> 00:05:53,120
Report to the officials?

88
00:05:54,240 --> 00:05:55,770
I ran away from the theater,

89
00:05:56,159 --> 00:05:57,560
and burned them to death.

90
00:05:58,040 --> 00:06:00,170
Haven't you been wanting me all along?

91
00:06:00,720 --> 00:06:02,980
While the three of them were living well.

92
00:06:03,480 --> 00:06:04,560
Report to the officials?

93
00:06:04,560 --> 00:06:05,690
Would you believe me

94
00:06:05,800 --> 00:06:07,000
or them?

95
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:12,330
However,

96
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:15,240
there's still one thing left unfinished.

97
00:06:15,240 --> 00:06:16,160
I hope you two

98
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:17,820
can uphold justice for me.

99
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:20,560
I will repay you generously in my next life.

100
00:06:20,920 --> 00:06:21,720
Please speak.

101
00:06:22,920 --> 00:06:25,000
I had a little playmate named Cheng.

102
00:06:25,920 --> 00:06:28,520
I haven't been able to find him all these years.

103
00:06:28,720 --> 00:06:31,040
He is the culprit behind this whole thing.

104
00:06:31,040 --> 00:06:32,800
Help me catch him.

105
00:06:32,920 --> 00:06:34,850
Cheng, who deceived you back then,

106
00:06:35,040 --> 00:06:36,040
was sold to another troupe

107
00:06:36,040 --> 00:06:37,570
by Zhang Ergou and his gang.

108
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:40,040
That troupe was even more cruel.

109
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:40,800
Cheng

110
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:43,720
died at the age of ten.

111
00:06:44,040 --> 00:06:48,920
Let me out! Let me out!

112
00:06:52,920 --> 00:06:55,680
Karma! Karma!

113
00:06:56,920 --> 00:06:57,600
Xu Lin,

114
00:06:58,040 --> 00:06:59,770
the yamen has issued a verdict.

115
00:06:59,800 --> 00:07:02,360
You are sentenced to immediate execution for intentional homicide.

116
00:07:02,360 --> 00:07:03,720
I have taken my revenge.

117
00:07:04,360 --> 00:07:06,820
I have nothing left to long for in this world.

118
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:12,160
Save him.

119
00:07:12,160 --> 00:07:12,800
Okay.

120
00:07:14,480 --> 00:07:15,480
Wait.

121
00:07:18,840 --> 00:07:19,640
It's too late.

122
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:21,480
Perhaps death

123
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:23,240
is a mercy to him.

124
00:07:54,720 --> 00:07:56,360
This case is finally over.

125
00:07:57,680 --> 00:07:58,800
If

126
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:01,160
Xu Lin hadn't been trafficked back then,

127
00:08:01,160 --> 00:08:02,120
maybe now

128
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:04,210
he would be living a happy life.

129
00:08:07,720 --> 00:08:08,800
Buddha says

130
00:08:09,360 --> 00:08:12,960
there are one hundred and eight kinds of suffering in this world.

131
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:15,600
Observe others and examine yourself.

132
00:08:15,600 --> 00:08:17,360
A gentleman should be careful when alone.

133
00:08:17,360 --> 00:08:18,400
The way of the sage

134
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:20,120
is to save the world.

135
00:08:23,240 --> 00:08:24,840
What's wrong with you today?

136
00:08:25,040 --> 00:08:26,680
You want to save the world,

137
00:08:27,240 --> 00:08:29,170
talking as if you were the emperor.

138
00:08:30,240 --> 00:08:31,900
The rise and fall of the nation

139
00:08:31,920 --> 00:08:32,840
is everyone's responsibility.
